; ---- ESC QUITS (2026-10-29): the move reader's SERIN at $416B jumps here (past the end marker, so no
;      address moves). A lone ESC (nothing more within ~30 ms) ends the game; an arrow's ESC [ x is thrown away.
; $4300 SERIN / TESTAI 001B / IFFALSEI $432E          not ESC: back to the reader's Enter test
; $4307 LOADXI R9 0008 / $430B SERST / IFTRUEI $431B  more coming: an arrow
; $430F DECX R9 / TESTXZ R9 / IFFALSEI $430B
; $4316 SEROUTI 0D / SEROUTI 0A / HALT               ESC on its own: the end
; $431B SERIN (thrown away) / LOADXI R9 0008 / $4320 SERST / IFTRUEI $431B / DECX R9 / TESTXZ R9 /
;       IFFALSEI $4320 / GAL $4169                    the arrow read: the next key
; $432E TESTAI 000D / GAL $416F                       the reader's own test, as before
D 4300 CB 81 00 1B A1 03 2E 11 09 00 08 CC A0 03 1B 43
D 4310 09 8C 09 A1 03 0B CA 0D CA 0A 00 CB 11 09 00 08
D 4320 CC A0 03 1B 43 09 8C 09 A1 03 20 B0 01 69 81 00
D 4330 0D B0 01 6F

